# notesync secret-scan allowlist
#
# One entry per line. Anything after " #" is a comment.
#   fp:<fingerprint>   ignore one specific finding (fingerprints are printed by `notesync scan`)
#   match:<text>       ignore a literal value wherever it appears
#   path:<glob>        ignore every finding in matching files (supports *, ** and ?)
#   rule:<rule-id>     turn a rule off entirely (use sparingly)
#
# `notesync scan --accept-warnings` appends fp: lines for every current WARNING.
# HIGH findings are never auto-accepted: fix the note, or add the fp: line by hand.

